#: utils/schemeparser.h:154
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>The following placeholders will be replaced with their particular meaning:"
"</p><table><tr><th>Placeholder</th><th>Description</th></tr><tr><td><tt>"
"$artist</tt></td><td>The artist of the CD. If your CD is a compilation then "
"this tag represents the title in most cases.</td></tr><tr><td><tt>$title</"
"tt></td><td>The title of the CD. If your CD is a compilation then this tag "
"represents the subtitle in most cases.</td></tr><tr><td><tt>$date</tt></"
"td><td>The release date of the CD. In almost all cases this is the year.</"
"td></tr><tr><td><tt>$genre</tt></td><td>The genre of the CD.</td></"
"tr><tr><td><tt>$cdno</tt></td><td>The CD number of a multi-CD album. Often "
"compilations consist of several CDs. <i>Note:</i> If the multi-CD flag is "
"<b>not</b> set for the current CD then this value will be empty.</td></"
"tr><tr><td><tt>$nooftracks</tt></td><td>The total number of audio tracks of "
"the CD.</td></tr><tr><td><tt>$encoder</tt></td><td>Encoder name and version."
"</td></tr><tr><td><tt>$audex</tt></td><td>Audex name and version.</td></tr></"
"table>"
msgstr "<p>Sljedeći će se rezervni znakovi zamijeniti odgovarajućim vrijednostima:</p><table><tr><th>Rezervni znak</th><th>Opis</th></tr><tr><td><tt>$artist</tt></td><td>Izvođač CD-a; na kompilaciji ova oznaka najčešće predstavlja naslov.</td></tr><tr><td><tt>$title</tt></td><td>Naslov CD-a; na kompilaciji ova oznaka najčešće predstavlja podnaslov.</td></tr><tr><td><tt>$date</tt></td><td>Datum izdanja CD-a; gotovo uvijek riječ je o godini.</td></tr><tr><td><tt>$genre</tt></td><td>Žanr CD-a.</td></tr><tr><td><tt>$cdno</tt></td><td>Broj CD-a u albumu s više CD-ova. Kompilacije se često sastoje od nekoliko CD-ova. <i>Napomena:</i> Ako za CD nije postavljena oznaka više CD-ova, ova će vrijednost biti prazna.</td></tr><tr><td><tt>$nooftracks</tt></td><td>Ukupan broj zvučnih pjesama na CD-u.</td></tr><tr><td><tt>$encoder</tt></td><td>Naziv i inačica kodera.</td></tr><tr><td><tt>$audex</tt></td><td>Naziv i inačica Audexa.</td></tr></table>"

#: utils/schemeparser.h:171
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>Placeholders in Audex can have parameters in the form key=value. E.g. <tt>"
"${title lowercase=true}</tt>. In this example the title will be lowercased. "
"The following general parameters can be used with placeholders:</"
"p><table><tr><th>Key</th><th>Value</th><th>Description</th></"
"tr><tr><td><tt>lowercase</tt></td><td>true/false</td><td>The placeholder "
"value will be lowercased.</td></tr><tr><td><tt>uppercase</tt></td><td>true/"
"false</td><td>The placeholder value will be uppercased.</td></"
"tr><tr><td><tt>underscores</tt></td><td>true/false</td><td>Replace the "
"spaces of the placeholder value with underscores.</td></"
"tr><tr><td><tt>fat32compatible</tt></td><td>true/false</td><td>Replace "
"illegal filename characters of a FAT32 filesystem with underscores.</td></"
"tr><tr><td><tt>replace_chars</tt></td><td>true/false</td><td>Replace "
"characters. This parameter needs two additional keys of the same value size:"
"<tt>replace_char_list_from</tt>, <tt>replace_char_list_to</tt>. These are "
"lists of characters. The first character of<tt>replace_char_list_from</tt> "
"will be replaced by the first character of <tt>replace_char_list_to</tt> and "
"so on.</td></tr><tr><td><tt>left</tt></td><td>Number</td><td>Take nth "
"characters from the left of the placeholder value.</td></"
"tr><tr><td><tt>length</tt></td><td>Number</td><td>If the placeholder value "
"is a number expand it to the given length. Furthermore you can define a fill "
"character with the additional key <tt>fillchar</tt>. Default fillchar is '0'."
"</td></tr><tr><td><tt>pre</tt></td><td>String</td><td>A string which will be "
"placed <b>before</b> the value. Especially useful for command line "
"parameters which should not be set at all if the value is empty.</td></"
"tr><tr><td><tt>post</tt></td><td>String</td><td>A string which will be "
"placed <b>after</b> the value.</td></tr></table>"
msgstr "<p>Rezervni znakovi u Audexu mogu imati parametre u obliku ključ=vrijednost. Npr. <tt>${title lowercase=true}</tt>. U ovom se primjeru naslov pretvara u mala slova. Uz rezervne znakove mogu se upotrijebiti sljedeći opći parametri:</p><table><tr><th>Ključ</th><th>Vrijednost</th><th>Opis</th></tr><tr><td><tt>lowercase</tt></td><td>true/false</td><td>Vrijednost rezervnog znaka pretvara se u mala slova.</td></tr><tr><td><tt>uppercase</tt></td><td>true/false</td><td>Vrijednost rezervnog znaka pretvara se u velika slova.</td></tr><tr><td><tt>underscores</tt></td><td>true/false</td><td>Razmaci u vrijednosti rezervnog znaka zamjenjuju se podvlakama.</td></tr><tr><td><tt>fat32compatible</tt></td><td>true/false</td><td>Nedopušteni znakovi u nazivima datoteka na datotečnom sustavu FAT32 zamjenjuju se podvlakama.</td></tr><tr><td><tt>replace_chars</tt></td><td>true/false</td><td>Zamjenjuje znakove. Ovaj parametar zahtijeva dva dodatna ključa jednakog broja znakova: <tt>replace_char_list_from</tt> i <tt>replace_char_list_to</tt>. To su popisi znakova. Prvi znak vrijednosti ključa <tt>replace_char_list_from</tt> zamijenit će se prvim znakom vrijednosti ključa <tt>replace_char_list_to</tt> i tako redom.</td></tr><tr><td><tt>left</tt></td><td>Broj</td><td>Uzima zadani broj znakova s lijeve strane vrijednosti rezervnog znaka.</td></tr><tr><td><tt>length</tt></td><td>Broj</td><td>Ako je vrijednost rezervnog znaka broj, proširuje je na zadanu duljinu. Dodatnim ključem <tt>fillchar</tt> može se odrediti znak za popunjavanje. Zadani znak je „0”.</td></tr><tr><td><tt>pre</tt></td><td>Niz</td><td>Niz koji se postavlja <b>ispred</b> vrijednosti. Posebno je koristan za parametre naredbenog retka koji se ne smiju postaviti kad je vrijednost prazna.</td></tr><tr><td><tt>post</tt></td><td>Niz</td><td>Niz koji se postavlja <b>iza</b> vrijednosti.</td></tr></table>"

#: utils/schemeparser.h:192
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<table><tr><th>Placeholder</th><th>Description</th></tr><tr><td>$tartist</"
"td><td>This is the artist of every track. It is especially useful on "
"compilation CDs.</td></tr><tr><td>$ttitle</td><td>The track title. Normally "
"each track on a CD has its own title, which is the name of the song.</td></"
"tr><tr><td>$trackno</td><td>The track number. First track is 1.</td></"
"tr><tr><td><tt>$isrc</tt></td><td>The International Standard Recording Code "
"(ISRC) of the track (only available if supported by your device).</td></tr></"
"table>"
msgstr "<table><tr><th>Rezervni znak</th><th>Opis</th></tr><tr><td>$tartist</td><td>Izvođač svake pjesme. Posebno je koristan na kompilacijskim CD-ovima.</td></tr><tr><td>$ttitle</td><td>Naslov pjesme; svaka pjesma na CD-u obično ima vlastiti naslov, odnosno naziv pjesme.</td></tr><tr><td>$trackno</td><td>Broj pjesme. Prva pjesma ima broj 1.</td></tr><tr><td><tt>$isrc</tt></td><td>Međunarodni standardni kod snimke (ISRC) pjesme (dostupan samo ako ga uređaj podržava).</td></tr></table>"

#: utils/schemeparser.h:204
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<table><tr><th>Placeholder</th><th>Specific parameter</th><th>Description</"
"th></tr><tr><td><tt>$i</tt></td><td></td><td>The temporary WAVE file (RIFF "
"WAVE) created by Audex from CD audio track. This is the input file for your "
"command line encoder.</td></tr><tr><td><tt>$o</tt></td><td></td><td>The full "
"output filename and path. Use it as the output for your command line encoder."
"</td></tr><tr><td><tt>$cover</tt></td><td><tt>format,x,y</tt></"
"td><td>Filename of the cover file. If no cover is set, this will be empty. "
"Mostly useful in conjunction with the <tt>pre</tt> parameter. Image can be "
"scaled with the <tt>x</tt> and <tt>y</tt> parameters. Possible image "
"<tt>formats</tt> are JPEG, PNG, GIF or BMP (Default: JPEG). <i><b>Note:</b> "
"LAME discards cover files larger than 128 KiB.</i></td></tr></table>"
msgstr "<table><tr><th>Rezervni znak</th><th>Parametar</th><th>Opis</th></tr><tr><td><tt>$i</tt></td><td></td><td>Privremena WAVE datoteka (RIFF WAVE) koju Audex stvara iz zvučne pjesme na CD-u. To je ulazna datoteka za koder naredbenog retka.</td></tr><tr><td><tt>$o</tt></td><td></td><td>Puni naziv i putanja izlazne datoteke. Upotrijebi ih kao izlaz za koder naredbenog retka.</td></tr><tr><td><tt>$cover</tt></td><td><tt>format,x,y</tt></td><td>Naziv datoteke naslovnice. Ako naslovnica nije postavljena, vrijednost će biti prazna. Najčešće se upotrebljava s parametrom <tt>pre</tt>. Sliku je moguće promijeniti parametrima <tt>x</tt> i <tt>y</tt>. Mogući formati slike su JPEG, PNG, GIF ili BMP (zadano: JPEG). <i><b>Napomena:</b> LAME odbacuje datoteke naslovnica veće od 128 KiB.</i></td></tr></table>"

#: utils/schemeparser.h:218
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<table><tr><th>Placeholder</th><th>Specific parameter</th><th>Description</"
"th></tr><tr><td>$size</td><td><tt>iec,precision</tt></td><td>Prints the "
"overall size of all extracted (encoded) music files (incl. the cover image "
"file). With <tt>iec</tt> calculate (k)ibi, (m)ebi or (g)ibi. The additional "
"parameter <tt>precision</tt> can define the number of decimal places.</td></"
"tr><tr><td>$length</td><td></td><td>Prints the relevant overall length of "
"all extracted tracks. The format is min:sec.</td></tr><tr><td>$nooftracks</"
"td><td></td><td>Prints the total number of extracted tracks.</td></"
"tr><tr><td>$discid</td><td>base</td><td>Prints the CDDB discid in "
"hexadecimal format.</td></tr><tr><td><tt>$mcn</tt></td><td></td><td>The "
"Media Catalog Number (MCN) of the CD (only available if supported by your "
"device).</td></tr><tr><td>$now</td><td><tt>format,locale</tt></td><td>Prints "
"the current date and/or time. The parameter format specifies the output. "
"Please consult official qt documentation (<tt>https://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qtime."
"html#toString</tt>, <tt>https://doc.qt.io/qt-6/qdate.html#toString</tt>) for "
"the supported specifiers within the format string. With the additional key "
"<tt>locale</tt> you can specify a language setting. By default your system "
"locales are used. The locale has the format <tt>language_TERRITORY</tt>, e."
"g. <tt>en_EN</tt>. <tt>language</tt> is a lowercase, two-letter, ISO 639 "
"language code and <tt>TERRITORY</tt> an uppercase, two-letter, ISO 3166 "
"territory code.</td></tr><tr><td>$br</td><td></td><td>Prints a linebreak.</"
"td></tr></table>"
msgstr "<table><tr><th>Rezervni znak</th><th>Parametar</th><th>Opis</th></tr><tr><td>$size</td><td><tt>iec,precision</tt></td><td>Ispisuje ukupnu veličinu svih izdvojenih (kodiranih) glazbenih datoteka, uključujući datoteku naslovnice. Parametrom <tt>iec</tt> odredi jedinice (k)ibi, (m)ebi ili (g)ibi. Dodatnim parametrom <tt>precision</tt> određuje se broj decimalnih mjesta.</td></tr><tr><td>$length</td><td></td><td>Ispisuje ukupno trajanje svih izdvojenih pjesama u obliku min:sek.</td></tr><tr><td>$nooftracks</td><td></td><td>Ispisuje ukupan broj izdvojenih pjesama.</td></tr><tr><td>$discid</td><td>base</td><td>Ispisuje ID diska CDDB u heksadecimalnom obliku.</td></tr><tr><td><tt>$mcn</tt></td><td></td><td>Broj medijskog kataloga (MCN) CD-a (dostupan samo ako ga uređaj podržava).</td></tr><tr><td>$now</td><td><tt>format,locale</tt></td><td>Ispisuje trenutačni datum i/ili vrijeme. Parametar format određuje izlazni oblik. Podržane specifikacije potraži u službenoj dokumentaciji Qt-a (<tt>https://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qtime.html#toString</tt>, <tt>https://doc.qt.io/qt-6/qdate.html#toString</tt>) za podržane specifikatore u nizu formata. Dodatnim ključem <tt>locale</tt> možeš odrediti jezičnu postavku. Zadano se upotrebljavaju lokalne postavke sustava. Lokalna postavka ima oblik <tt>language_TERRITORY</tt>, npr. <tt>en_EN</tt>. <tt>language</tt> je dvoslovna oznaka jezika prema normi ISO 639, pisana malim slovima, a <tt>TERRITORY</tt> dvoslovna oznaka područja prema normi ISO 3166, pisana velikim slovima.</td></tr><tr><td>$br</td><td></td><td>Ispisuje prijelom retka.</td></tr></table>"

