#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_fullParanoiaMode)
#: widgets/devicewidgetUI.ui:29
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<html><head/><body><p>Use some special techniques to reduce the chance of "
"unnoticed reading errors. Leads to a more secure reading process at the "
"expense of ripping speed, so it might be also called \"secure mode\".</p></"
"body></html>"
msgstr "<html><head/><body><p>Upotrijebi posebne tehnike kako bi se smanjila vjerojatnost neprimijećenih pogrešaka pri čitanju. Time se čitanje čini pouzdanijim, ali je izdvajanje sporije, pa se ovaj način može nazvati i „sigurnim načinom”.</p></body></html>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_skipReadErrors)
#: widgets/devicewidgetUI.ui:39
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<html><head/><body><p>Skip reading errors for a sector (sector length: 1/75 "
"second) after retrying to read it. Please specify the number of retry "
"attempts under <span style=\" font-style:italic;\">Retries on read error</"
"span>. If skipped, null samples will be written for the faulty sectors.</p></"
"body></html>"
msgstr "<html><head/><body><p>Preskoči pogreške pri čitanju sektora (duljina sektora: 1/75 sekunde) nakon ponovnih pokušaja čitanja. Broj pokušaja odredi u polju <span style=\" font-style:italic;\">Broj ponovnih pokušaja pri pogrešci čitanja</span>. Ako se sektor preskoči, neispravni će se sektori ispuniti nul-uzorcima.</p></body></html>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QLabel, label)
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QSpinBox, kcfg_sampleShift)
#: widgets/devicewidgetUI.ui:51 widgets/devicewidgetUI.ui:73
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<html><head/><body><p>Some drives have a sample offset when reading audio "
"CDs. To determine the correct offset for your drive model, you can check the "
"<a href=\"https://www.accuraterip.com/driveoffsets.htm\"><span style=\" text-"
"decoration: underline; color:#2980b9;\">Accuraterip</span></a> database.</"
"p></body></html>"
msgstr "<html><head/><body><p>Neki pogoni imaju pomak uzoraka pri čitanju zvučnih CD-ova. Ispravan pomak za svoj model pogona možeš pronaći u bazi <a href=\"https://www.accuraterip.com/driveoffsets.htm\"><span style=\" text-decoration: underline; color:#2980b9;\">Accuraterip</span></a>.</p></body></html>"

